        "content": "<div style=\"background: transparent; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(159, 179, 200, 0.22); padding: 8px 4px 12px 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n  <div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; letter-spacing: 0.2px; line-height: 1.25;\">NASA EONET v3 + NASA POWER &mdash; Global Hazard Operations &amp; Horizon Forecast</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 5px; line-height: 1.4;\">Real-Time Lakehouse: <span style=\"color:#73bf69; font-weight:600;\">Kafka KRaft</span> &rarr; <span style=\"color:#5794f2; font-weight:600;\">Spark Structured Streaming</span> &rarr; <span style=\"color:#ff9830; font-weight:600;\">TimescaleDB</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Filter by <b>Category</b> or <b>Search Event</b> above to auto-zoom onto any hazard.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;\">\n    <span style=\"border: 1px solid #73bf69; color: #73bf69; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">&#9679; LIVE STREAMING</span>\n    <span style=\"border: 1px solid #5794f2; color: #5794f2; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">CHAMPION / SHADOW ML</span>\n  </div>\n</div>",
